["in",87.22,87.38],["the",87.38,87.5],["following",87.5,87.78],["year",87.78,88.36]]},{"start":88.36,"end":94.54,"text":"rented a small workshop and set up a new company, Reynolds Electrical, so the","words":[["rented",88.36,88.9],["a",88.9,89.14],["small",89.14,89.44],["workshop",89.44,90.04],["and",90.04,90.58],["set",90.58,90.84],["up",90.84,90.98],["a",90.98,91.14],["new",91.14,91.3],["company,",91.3,91.78],["Reynolds",92.24,92.56],["Electrical,",92.56,93.28],["so",93.86,94.36],["the",94.36,94.54]]},{"start":94.54,"end":100.12,"text":"company dates back to 1928 and I'm pleased to say we've been successful","words":[["company",94.54,94.9],["dates",94.9,95.56],["back",95.56,95.86],["to",95.86,96.1],["1928",96.1,97.14],["and",97.14,97.9],["I'm",97.9,98.08],["pleased",98.08,98.32],["to",98.32,98.56],["say",98.56,98.84],["we've",98.84,99.32],["been",99.32,99.5],["successful",99.5,100.12]]},{"start":100.12,"end":107.1,"text":"more or less ever since and we moved to our present site in 1955. There was a","words":[["more",100.12,100.68],["or",100.68,100.8],["less",100.8,101.0],["ever",101.0,101.2],["since",101.2,101.58],["and",101.58,102.46],["we",102.46,102.64],["moved",102.64,102.88],["to",102.88,103.12],["our",103.12,103.3],["present",103.3,103.62],["site",103.62,104.08],["in",104.08,104.4],["1955.",104.4,105.28],["There",106.26,106.78],["was",106.78,106.94],["a",106.94,107.1]]},{"start":107.1,"end":112.46,"text":"cinema here which had to be demolished and new buildings were put up. Of","words":[["cinema",107.1,107.44],["here",107.44,107.9],["which",107.9,108.56],["had",108.56,108.76],["to",108.76,108.9],["be",108.9,109.0],["demolished",109.0,109.66],["and",109.66,110.12],["new",110.12,110.34],["buildings",110.34,110.72],["were",110.72,111.02],["put",111.02,111.12],["up.",111.12,111.46],["Of",112.16,112.46]]},{"start":112.46,"end":115.82,"text":"course in those days it was quite common to have factories close to","words":[["course",112.46,112.64],["in",112.64,112.82],["those",112.82,113.02],["days",113.02,113.34],["it",113.34,113.6],["was",113.6,113.78],["quite",113.78,114.04],["common",114.04,114.36],["to",114.36,114.6],["have",114.6,114.74],["factories",114.74,115.18],["close",115.18,115.58],["to",115.58,115.82]]},{"start":115.82,"end":122.62,"text":"town centres. The company has been more and more successful in the last few years. The","words":[["town",115.82,116.08],["centres.",116.08,116.6],["The",117.74,118.42],["company",118.42,118.72],["has",118.72,118.98],["been",118.98,119.14],["more",119.14,119.5],["and",119.5,119.64],["more",119.64,119.84],["successful",119.84,120.32],["in",120.32,120.7],["the",120.7,120.8],["last",120.8,121.06],["few",121.06,121.3],["years.",121.3,121.68],["The",122.5,122.62]]},{"start":122.62,"end":129.48,"text":"main reason is a change in the pattern of sales. Another reason for our success is that despite","words":[["main",122.62,122.88],["reason",122.88,123.28],["is",123.28,123.62],["a",123.62,123.78],["change",123.78,124.1],["in",124.1,124.32],["the",124.32,124.42],["pattern",124.42,124.7],["of",124.7,124.88],["sales.",124.88,125.36],["Another",126.54,126.86],["reason",126.86,127.36],["for",127.36,127.6],["our",127.6,127.8],["success",127.8,128.14],["is",128.14,128.92],["that",128.92,129.12],["despite",129.12,129.48]]},{"start":129.48,"end":135.7,"text":"strong competition from cheaper competitors, our customers are happy to pay a higher price","words":[["strong",129.48,129.94],["competition",129.94,130.5],["from",130.5,131.0],["cheaper",131.0,131.5],["competitors,",131.5,132.1],["our",132.92,133.04],["customers",133.04,133.44],["are",133.44,133.96],["happy",133.96,134.3],["to",134.3,134.58],["pay",134.58,134.82],["a",134.82,134.92],["higher",134.92,135.18],["price",135.18,135.7]]},{"start":135.7,"end":141.46,"text":"for the quality of Reynolds goods. Because of this success, we're feeling confident","words":[["for",135.7,136.12],["the",136.12,136.22],["quality",136.22,136.7],["of",136.7,136.94],["Reynolds",136.94,137.26],["goods.",137.26,137.66],["Because",138.48,139.0],["of",139.0,139.22],["this",139.22,139.38],["success,",139.38,139.88],["we're",140.24,140.62],["feeling",140.62,140.92],["confident",140.92,141.46]]},{"start":141.46,"end":144.4,"text":"about the future and we've got some exciting plans.","words":[["about",141.46,141.76],["the",141.76,142.0],["future",142.0,142.36],["and",142.36,143.0],["we've",143.0,143.18],["got",143.18,143.32],["some",143.32,143.5],["exciting",143.5,143.9],["plans.",143.9,144.4]]},{"start":145.38,"end":150.08,"text":"We're now constructing a second factory so that we can increase production.","words":[["We're",145.38,145.92],["now",145.92,146.12],["constructing",146.12,146.72],["a",146.72,146.98],["second",146.98,147.38],["factory",147.38,148.0],["so",148.0,148.62],["that",148.62,148.78],["we",148.78,148.92],["can",148.92,149.1],["increase",149.1,149.48],["production.",149.48,150.08]]},{"start":150.9,"end":154.26,"text":"We're also replacing our existing production machinery","words":[["We're",150.9,151.14],["also",151.14,151.54],["replacing",151.54,152.14],["our",152.14,152.52],["existing",152.52,152.94],["production",152.94,153.5],["machinery",153.5,154.26]]},{"start":154.26,"end":156.82,"text":"and making improvements to all the offices.","words":[["and",154.26,154.88],["making",154.88,155.18],["improvements",155.18,155.76],["to",155.76,156.12],["all",156.12,156.32],["the",156.32,156.46],["offices.",156.46,156.82]]},{"start":157.88,"end":163.18,"text":"One more point I'd like to make is that ever since Tony Reynolds started the business","words":[["One",157.88,158.6],["more",158.6,158.84],["point",158.84,159.16],["I'd",159.16,159.4],["like",159.4,159.52],["to",159.52,159.7],["make",159.7,159.96],["is",159.96,160.46],["that",160.46,160.62],["ever",160.62,160.86],["since",160.86,161.18],["Tony",161.18,161.54],["Reynolds",161.54,162.02],["started",162.02,162.58],["the",162.58,162.78],["business",162.78,163.18]]},{"start":163.18,"end":166.34,"text":"we've always tried to be the best in our field.","words":[["we've",163.18,163.84],["always",163.84,164.28],["tried",164.28,164.66],["to",164.66,164.86],["be",164.86,165.0],["the",165.0,165.1],["best",165.1,165.52],["in",165.52,165.7],["our",165.7,165.88],["field.",165.88,166.34]]},{"start":166.34,"end":172.8,"text":"So earlier this year, we were delighted when we received an award for making a big reduction","words":[["So",166.34,167.32],["earlier",167.32,167.72],["this",167.72,168.02],["year,",168.02,168.36],["we",168.7,168.84],["were",168.84,169.0],["delighted",169.0,169.54],["when",169.54,170.2],["we",170.2,170.38],["received",170.38,170.78],["an",170.78,171.0],["award",171.0,171.32],["for",171.32,171.62],["making",171.62,171.82],["a",171.82,172.06],["big",172.06,172.36],["reduction",172.36,172.8]]},{"start":172.8,"end":177.48,"text":"in waste. Our policy is to recycle as much as we can.","words":[["in",172.8,173.1],["waste.",173.1,173.56],["Our",174.16,174.38],["policy",174.38,174.84],["is",174.84,175.28],["to",175.28,175.44],["recycle",175.44,176.1],["as",176.1,176.52],["much",176.52,176.84],["as",176.84,176.98],["we",176.98,177.14],["can.",177.14,177.48]]},{"start":181.02,"end":186.62,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 17-20.","words":[["Before",181.02,181.48],["you",181.48,181.76],["hear",181.76,182.02],["the",182.02,182.2],["rest",182.2,182.44],["of",182.44,182.56],["the",182.56,182.64],["talk,",182.64,182.96],["you",183.36,183.54],["have",183.54,183.74],["some",183.74,183.92],["time",183.92,184.4],["to",184.4,184.64],["look",184.64,184.76],["at",184.76,184.9],["questions",184.9,185.08],["17",185.08,186.06],["-20.",186.06,186.62]]},{"start":206.92,"end":215.6,"text":"Now listen and answer questions 17-20. Right, now I'll give you an idea of what","words":[["Now",206.92,207.26],["listen",207.26,207.56],["and",207.56,208.0],["answer",208.0,208.42],["questions",208.42,208.74],["17",208.74,209.78],["-20.",209.78,210.34],["Right,",213.56,214.04],["now",214.16,214.3],["I'll",214.3,214.54],["give",214.54,214.68],["you",214.68,214.82],["an",214.82,214.94],["idea",214.94,215.26],["of",215.26,215.46],["what",215.46,215.6]]},{"start":215.6,"end":220.7,"text":"you'll be doing in the next few days. You'll spend most of this week with different","words":[["you'll",215.6,215.78],["be",215.78,215.88],["doing",215.88,216.18],["in",216.18,216.36],["the",216.36,216.44],["next",216.44,216.7],["few",216.7,216.94],["days.",216.94,217.3],["You'll",218.3,218.78],["spend",218.78,219.06],["most",219.06,219.4],["of",219.4,219.6],["this",219.6,219.8],["week",219.8,220.1],["with",220.1,220.38],["different",220.38,220.7]]},{"start":220.7,"end":225.78,"text":"members of our staff working alongside them so that you can learn what their job involves.","words":[["members",220.7,221.04],["of",221.04,221.24],["our",221.24,221.4],["staff",221.4,221.9],["working",221.9,222.74],["alongside",222.74,223.22],["them",223.22,223.66],["so",223.66,223.92],["that",223.92,224.1],["you",224.1,224.2],["can",224.2,224.38],["learn",224.38,224.64],["what",224.64,224.88],["their",224.88,225.08],["job",225.08,225.38],["involves.",225.38,225.78]]},{"start":226.7,"end":232.38,"text":"And we'll get together at three o'clock every afternoon to focus on a different part of our work.","words":[["And",226.7,227.0],["we'll",227.0,227.26],["get",227.26,227.42],["together",227.42,227.86],["at",227.86,228.14],["three",228.14,228.4],["o",228.4,228.58],["'clock",228.58,228.88],["every",228.88,229.18],["afternoon",229.18,229.8],["to",229.8,230.32],["focus",230.32,230.66],["on",230.66,230.98],["a",230.98,231.08],["different",231.08,231.36],["part",231.36,231.7],["of",231.7,231.88],["our",231.88,232.04],["work.",232.04,232.38]]},{"start":233.4,"end":237.54,"text":"Every Monday we have a meeting of people from different parts of the company","words":[["Every",233.4,233.82],["Monday",233.82,234.24],["we",234.24,234.66],["have",234.66,234.94],["a",234.94,235.02],["meeting",235.02,235.24],["of",235.24,235.5],["people",235.5,235.84],["from",235.84,236.16],["different",236.16,236.44],["parts",236.44,236.88],["of",236.88,237.04],["the",237.04,237.14],["company",237.14,237.54]]},{"start":237.54,"end":240.68,"text":"and I'd like you to take part in this afternoon's meeting.","words":[["and",237.54,238.22],["I'd",238.22,238.44],["like",238.44,238.54],["you",238.54,238.74],["to",238.74,238.86],["take",238.86,239.06],["part",239.06,239.38],["in",239.38,239.6],["this",239.6,239.74],["afternoon's",239.74,240.42],["meeting.",240.42,240.68]]},{"start":241.66,"end":245.5,"text":"Today we're going to discuss ways of getting higher levels of safety","words":[["Today",241.66,242.12],["we're",242.12,242.54],["going",242.54,242.72],["to",242.72,242.84],["discuss",242.84,243.14],["ways",243.14,243.56],["of",243.56,243.8],["getting",243.8,244.02],["higher",244.02,244.48],["levels",244.48,244.82],["of",244.82,245.02],["safety",245.02,245.5]]},{"start":245.5,"end":249.1,"text":"and we'll be interested in any suggestions you might make.","words":[["and",245.5,246.26],["we'll",246.26,246.52],["be",246.52,246.66],["interested",246.66,247.06],["in",247.06,247.3],["any",247.3,247.62],["suggestions",247.62,248.12],["you",248.12,248.48],["might",248.48,248.74],["make.",248.74,249.1]]},{"start":249.1,"end":252.38,"text":"So think about it while you're going around the factory today.","words":[["So",249.1,249.78],["think",249.78,250.02],["about",250.02,250.32],["it",250.32,250.54],["while",250.54,250.82],["you're",250.82,251.06],["going",251.06,251.22],["around",251.22,251.52],["the",251.52,251.66],["factory",251.66,252.0],["today.",252.0,252.38]]},{"start":253.6,"end":257.88,"text":"Tomorrow afternoon, Tuesday, I'll introduce you to the IT department","words":[["Tomorrow",253.6,254.16],["afternoon,",254.16,254.72],["Tuesday,",254.92,255.16],["I'll",255.94,256.2],["introduce",256.2,256.5],["you",256.5,256.82],["to",256.82,256.94],["the",256.94,257.08],["IT",257.08,257.4],["department",257.4,257.88]]},{"start":257.88,"end":261.22,"text":"and they'll update you about the changes to our website.","words":[["and",257.88,258.7],["they'll",258.7,258.98],["update",258.98,259.28],["you",259.28,259.56],["about",259.56,259.78],["the",259.78,259.98],["changes",259.98,260.28],["to",260.28,260.56],["our",260.56,260.7],["website.",260.7,261.22]]},{"start":261.84,"end":265.72,"text":"This is important because a growing number of people want to buy online.","words":[["This",261.84,262.24],["is",262.24,262.36],["important",262.36,262.82],["because",262.82,263.12],["a",263.12,263.3],["growing",263.3,263.58],["number",263.58,263.92],["of",263.92,264.08],["people",264.08,264.34],["want",264.34,264.68],["to",264.68,264.88],["buy",264.88,265.1],["online.",265.1,265.72]]},{"start":266.7,"end":272.04,"text":"Then on Wednesday, we'll talk about our contact with those very important people, customers.","words":[["Then",266.7,267.04],["on",267.04,267.22],["Wednesday,",267.22,267.64],["we'll",268.02,268.34],["talk",268.34,268.5],["about",268.5,268.78],["our",268.78,269.04],["contact",269.04,269.44],["with",269.44,269.78],["those",269.78,270.0],["very",270.0,270.36],["important",270.36,270.82],["people,",270.82,271.22],["customers.",271.7,272.04]]},{"start":272.9,"end":275.16,"text":"Without them, of course, we'd soon go out of business.","words":[["Without",272.9,273.26],["them,",273.26,273.54],["of",273.62,273.72],["course,",273.72,273.9],["we'd",274.1,274.32],["soon",274.32,274.46],["go",274.46,274.62],["out",274.62,274.82],["of",274.82,274.9],["business.",274.9,275.16]]},{"start":275.78,"end":281.42,"text":"And that discussion will cover all sorts of things, from advertising to research into","words":[["And",275.78,276.3],["that",276.3,276.46],["discussion",276.46,276.88],["will",276.88,277.12],["cover",277.12,277.38],["all",277.38,277.6],["sorts",277.6,278.02],["of",278.02,278.18],["things,",278.18,278.52],["from",278.86,279.18],["advertising",279.18,279.86],["to",279.86,280.46],["research",280.46,281.0],["into",281.0,281.42]]},{"start":281.42,"end":283.38,"text":"what sort of people buy our products.","words":[["what",281.42,281.68],["sort",281.68,281.86],["of",281.86,282.02],["people",282.02,282.24],["buy",282.24,282.66],["our",282.66,282.88],["products.",282.88,283.38]]},{"start":284.52,"end":290.4,"text":"The next afternoon, Thursday, we'll focus on recruitment and how we try to make sure","words":[["The",284.52,285.04],["next",285.04,285.24],["afternoon,",285.24,285.86],["Thursday,",286.36,286.62],["we'll",287.28,287.52],["focus",287.52,287.8],["on",287.8,288.06],["recruitment",288.06,288.54],["and",288.54,289.24],["how",289.24,289.4],["we",289.4,289.56],["try",289.56,289.76],["to",289.76,289.92],["make",289.92,290.08],["sure",290.08,290.4]]},{"start":290.4,"end":292.68,"text":"we have the best staff to meet our needs.","words":[["we",290.4,290.62],["have",290.62,290.82],["the",290.82,290.96],["best",290.96,291.26],["staff",291.26,291.62],["to",291.62,291.84],["meet",291.84,292.02],["our",292.02,292.26],["needs.",292.26,292.68]]},{"start":293.3,"end":297.24,"text":"We seem to be doing well because mostly they stay with us for several years.","words":[["We",293.3,293.52],["seem",293.52,293.74],["to",293.74,293.88],["be",293.88,293.96],["doing",293.96,294.16],["well",294.16,294.54],["because",294.54,294.92],["mostly",294.92,295.4],["they",295.4,295.64],["stay",295.64,295.92],["with",295.92,296.16],["us",296.16,296.3],["for",296.3,296.46],["several",296.46,296.76],["years.",296.76,297.24]]},{"start":298.4,"end":303.24,"text":"And finally, for this week at least, on Friday, something that I think you'll find","words":[["And",298.4,298.7],["finally,",298.7,299.14],["for",299.56,299.72],["this",299.72,299.88],["week",299.88,300.14],["at",300.14,300.34],["least,",300.34,300.7],["on",301.0,301.12],["Friday,",301.12,301.58],["something",302.02,302.24],["that",302.24,302.54],["I",302.54,302.7],["think",302.7,302.8],["you'll",302.8,303.1],["find",303.1,303.24]]},{"start":303.24,"end":308.36,"text":"more interesting than it sounds. And that's how we ensure we have sufficient","words":[["more",303.24,303.56],["interesting",303.56,304.02],["than",304.02,304.24],["it",304.24,304.36],["sounds.",304.36,304.8],["And",305.78,305.98],["that's",305.98,306.38],["how",306.38,306.56],["we",306.56,306.8],["ensure",306.8,307.26],["we",307.26,307.72],["have",307.72,307.94],["sufficient",307.94,308.36]]},{"start":308.36,"end":315.48,"text":"money coming in to pay our bills and other expenses such as wages. Right now","words":[["money",308.36,308.78],["coming",308.78,309.32],["in",309.32,309.66],["to",309.66,310.0],["pay",310.0,310.28],["our",310.28,310.52],["bills",310.52,310.94],["and",310.94,311.54],["other",311.54,311.72],["expenses",311.72,312.36],["such",312.36,312.92],["as",312.92,313.08],["wages.",313.08,313.46],["Right",314.68,315.14],["now",315.14,315.48]]},{"start":315.48,"end":324.89,"text":"are there any questions before I go on? That is the end of part two. You now have","words":[["are",315.48,315.8],["there",315.8,315.92],["any",315.92,316.08],["questions",316.08,316.58],["before",316.58,317.04],["I",317.04,317.38],["go",317.38,317.58],["on?",317.58,317.82],["That",321.31,321.75],["is",321.75,321.89],["the",321.89,322.05],["end",322.05,322.37],["of",322.37,322.51],["part",322.51,322.73],["two.",322.73,323.17],["You",323.89,324.29],["now",324.29,324.57],["have",324.57,324.89]]},{"start":324.89,"end":327.77,"text":"one minute to check your answers to part two.","words":[["one",324.89,325.25],["minute",325.25,325.65],["to",325.65,325.97],["check",325.97,326.27],["your",326.27,326.47],["answers",326.47,326.89],["to",326.89,327.13],["part",327.13,327.33],["two.",327.33,327.77]]}]}